@startuml
title SD02 Single Appeal and Dean Final Review
actor Student
boundary Browser as UI
control "Flask API and AuthService" as API
control ComplaintService as C
control RoutingPolicy as R
database "SQLite Repository" as DB
Student -> UI: Submit appeal
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/complaints/{id}/appeals
API -> API: Validate session, Student role, CSRF and input
API -> C: appeal(actor, id, justification, version)
C -> DB: Read complaint and rejecting level
DB --> C: Owner, status, appealed and version
break Access, eligibility or version failure
C --> API: 404 ownership or 409 state/version
API --> UI: Error, no mutation
end
C -> R: appealTarget(rejectedLevel)
alt Rejected at L1 or L2
R --> C: Next level, final_review=false
else Rejected at Dean
R --> C: Dean, final_review=true
end
critical One SQLite transaction
C -> DB: Insert unique appeal
Conditional update of Rejected and not appealed
Set Under Appeal Review, increment version
C -> DB: Record assignment history, APPEAL audit and notification
DB --> C: Transaction result, commit or error
end
break Concurrent update or persistence error
DB --> C: ROLLBACK
C --> API: 409 conflict or 503 persistence failure
API --> UI: Error, no partial mutation
end
C --> API: Appeal ID and assignment
API --> UI: 201 Created
UI --> Student: Appeal confirmation
@enduml
